      "worked_solution": "Notice that our solid can be written as a type III region.\n\nFor each point ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117154/assets/494198ee647d85e4442556a23f0c2d56aa601367360c321385ffc94523c47d73.svg) in the rectangular base region\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117154/assets/2d0c4af57f0ba5e29300533e6ab0d95ce702b9d75bf175cbb9ffdca5f371d634.svg)\nthe variable ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117154/assets/1d9b846cface9f9348e4081a0dd87dd254bf26663c12aa0d1a15aa24d2393261.svg) runs from the surface\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117154/assets/72a6a2c2ba533fff74fe6ff80bafa9db62c3cbbc81f8be01cb7f5846b95f8dc8.svg)\nup to the plane\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117154/assets/3692729086c0564b65a7865e92dc2d5930f72b59abc0ea7634cd6dfa539b71b1.svg)\n\nSo we can write:\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117154/assets/d7f58e8932311896757dffef5a240cb53a2b5e0b439455dbf83be832c8c15a01.svg)\n\nTherefore, the volume of ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117154/assets/085f4d77675f3cb7323d94feaa9eaa38f2fecb26c0f8483895f9ddf36b8d319d.svg) is given by the following triple integral:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14117154/assets/1e0c7ab5158a2e2dab67f2efae6ef29ac6be9e38bb9613c9c00a96d24c377a93.svg)",
